###    - Cross-service request tracking capabilities
###
### 2. SEVERITY-BASED ALERTING:
###    - INFO: Workflow progression and debugging details
###    - WARNING: Service degradation and retry attempts
###    - ERROR: Failure events requiring attention
###    - CRITICAL: System-wide failures needing immediate response
###
### 3. RICH CONTEXTUAL DATA:
